@startuml
title Academic Paper Reviewer route
skinparam shadowing false
actor User
participant "Host Agent" as Agent
participant "ResearchSpec CLI" as CLI
participant "academic-paper-reviewer" as Reviewer
database "Project files" as Files
Agent -> CLI : instructions route:academic-paper-reviewer:<mode>
CLI --> Agent : manuscript role/path\noutputs + Gates + cost
Agent -> User : confirm read-only review
User --> Agent : confirm
Agent -> CLI : start
Agent -> Reviewer : review handoff-referenced manuscript
Reviewer -> Files : review report / roadmap
Reviewer -> Files : update owning handoff
Agent -> User : Verify recommendation
User --> Agent : confirm Gate verdict
Agent -> CLI : decide gate:<instance>/<gate>
Agent -> CLI : advance subflow:<instance>
@enduml
